ill Jr. limped off the field with an injury in the first quarter against Michigan State on Friday night.","published":"2026-11-21T05:36:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50545816/oregon-running-back-dierre-hill-exits-vs-michigan-state-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Revised Protect College Sports Act allows conferences to expand up to 22 schools","description":"Federal lawmakers published a revised version of the Protect College Sports Act on Friday as the U.S. House of Representatives prepares to push for a vote during the first week of December. President Donald Trump also voiced his support for the bill.","published":"2026-11-21T02:51:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/story/_/id/50545220/protect-college-sports-act-revised-donald-trump-voices-support","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Dan Murphy","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College football games this weekend: Top 25 schedule","description":"Here's what to know about the college football slate for the Top 25 this weekend.","published":"2026-11-20T21:19:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50542897/college-football-games-top-25-schedule-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-20T20:45:02.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-20T20:32:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Miami WR Malachi Toney 'really close' to return after ankle surgery, coach says","description":"Miami star wide receiver Malachi Toney is about a week and a half from returning from surgery for a high ankle sprain, coach Mario Cristobal told \"The Pat McAfee Show.\"","published":"2026-11-20T19:00:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50542494/malachi-toney-nearing-return-ankle-surgery-coach-says","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Draft buzz: Interest in Oklahoma State's Drew Mestemaker could spur draft trade","description":"If the Titans or Chargers wind up with the No. 1 selection and stick with their franchise quarterbacks, interest in Oklahoma State's Drew Mestemaker could lead to a team seeking to trade up for the top overall pick.","published":"2026-11-20T21:59:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50541939/draft-buzz-mestemaker-spur-auction-no-1-pick","type":"Story","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: UGA big faves over Gamecocks, Vols slim favorites vs. LSU","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for South Carolina-Georgia, Tennessee-LSU and more.","published":"2026-11-20T15:55:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50498153/2026-college-football-week-12-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4707184/dj-mckinney","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DJ_McKinney"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"DJ McKinney","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DJ_McKinney","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:36:46Z","intro":"Dylahn Jordan McKinney (born February 9, 2004) is an American college football cornerback for the Notre Dame Fighting Irish. He previously played for the Oklahoma State Cowboys and Colorado Buffaloes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"McKinney attended Colleyville Heritage High School in Colleyville, Texas. He had 43 tackles and two interceptions his junior year and 35 tackles and five interceptions as a senior. He committed to Oklahoma State University to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"McKinney played at Oklahoma State in 2022 and 2023. After redshirting his first year in 2022, he played in all 14 games in 2023 and had 38 tackles. After the season, McKinney entered the transfer portal and transferred to the University of Colorado Boulder. In his first year at Colorado in 2024, he started all 13 games and had 62 tackles, three interceptions and one interception returned for a touchdown. McKinney returned in 2025, where he played nine games and had 35 tackles, one interception, and five pass breakups. At the end of the season, McKinney entered the transfer portal and transferred to Notre Dame."}]}}